flowchart TD
  step1["Inspect exact current source revision/version/hash and selection-preview hash; explicitly accept the current local-processing policy."]
  step2["Run the verified pinned local provider with fresh isolated capacity; inspect citations and current source authorization."]
  step3["For a private task candidate, select an anchor and current existing instruction action; review all contributing originals, complete audience and exact edited payload/hash."]
  step4["Publish deliberate canonical intent. If acknowledgement is unknown, preserve original request/key/body and check current publication-access before canonical replay."]
  step5["Test raw expiry separately from source/session revocation; read any separately retained task through its ordinary ACL."]
  record["Compare every expected result; record PASS, FAIL or BLOCKED for this run"]
  step1 --> step2
  step2 --> step3
  step3 --> step4
  step4 --> step5
  step5 --> record
